title: a shell script that runs no tests is still opaque production evidence, refused for a weakened assertion (D-199)
d199: D-199 (0.12) refuses repair evidence for this rule. The inputs are unchanged; they were the case deploy_script_still_opaque_neg, held at warn by that evidence. REPAIR_EVIDENCE_REFUSED pins that the production change still reached the finding.
origin: the honest residual of the 2026-08-07 round, pinned rather than
